      "type": "text",
      "text": [
        "Tribal Power's workshops are called **Echo stations**. Each one needs three things close together: something to work on, Pulse to spend, and the right **Resonance Totem** nearby to give it its voice.",
        "The first station you want is [Echo Shatter](echo_shatter). It breaks stone into an **Echo Shard**, the little crystal that will let you make power without drumming.",
        "Shatter needs an **Earth** totem. The totem is not a power source. Think of it as the station's teacher: without it, the station waits and spends nothing."
      ]
    },
